<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Wheat Pool details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Wheat Pool details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Wheat Pool on Thursday detailed the level of harvest progress as of Sept 9. CROP     SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>	   1996 91/95 Avg 1996 91/95 Avg</p>
<p>s.wheat   34   29	  19   32</p>
<p>durum     32   26	  23   35</p>
<p>oats	24   22	  11   30</p>
<p>barley    31   31	  26   39</p>
<p>canola    23   42	  24   35</p>
<p>flax	 6   17	   1    6</p>
<p>rye	 13    9	  78   85</p>
<p>w.wheat   14   16	  50   82</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
